@startuml player_draw_debug

package player {
  class Player {
    -- Fields --
    - aura: Aura
    - transparent: boolean
    - spriteNum: int
    - spriteCounter: int
    - screenX: int
    - screenY: int

    -- Methods --
    + draw(g2:Graphics2D): void
    + getWorldX(): int
    + getWorldY(): int
    + getScreenX(): int
    + getScreenY(): int
    + isTransparent(): boolean
    + getSolidArea(): Rectangle
    + getDirection(): String
    + getSpeed(): int
    + getCollisionBoxWorld(): Rectangle
  }
}

package window {
  class GameWindow {
    + getPlayer(): Player
    + getKeyHandler(): KeyHandler
    + getTileManager(): TileManager
    + getUi(): UI
  }
}

package aura {
  class Aura {
    - worldX: int
    - worldY: int
    - active: boolean
    + isActive(): boolean
    + setActive(b:boolean): void
    + getWorldX(): int
    + getWorldY(): int
    + drawAt(g2:Graphics2D, x:int, y:int, scale:float, alpha:float): void
  }
}

package tile {
  class TileManager {
    + getMapTileNum(): int[][]
    + getTiles(): Tile[]
  }
  class Tile {
    + collision: boolean
    + bombCollision: boolean
    + potCollision: boolean
  }
}

package input {
  class KeyHandler {
    + isShowDebugText(): boolean
  }
}

package ui {
  class UI {
    + getDamagePopupManager(): DamagePopupManager
  }
  class DamagePopupManager {
    + pop(text:String, x:int, y:int, variant:PopupVariant, duration:int): void
  }
}

package audio {
  class SoundManager {
    + damageWAV(path:String): void
    + defeatedWAV(path:String): void
    + explosionWAV(path:String): void
  }
}

package util {
  class Rectangle {
    + x:int
    + y:int
    + width:int
    + height:int
    + intersects(r:Rectangle): boolean
  }
  class FrameApp {
    + getTileSize(): int
  }
}

enum PopupVariant {
  MONSTER_DAMAGE
  PLAYER_DAMAGE
  XP
}

Player --> GameWindow : uses
Player --> Aura : draws
Player --> TileManager : queries
Player --> KeyHandler : queries
Player --> UI : uses
TileManager --> Tile : provides

note right of Player
**Notes**
- draw はプレイヤーとオーラを画面座標に変換して描画する。
- 無敵や透明状態では合成モードを変更して半透明で描画する。
- デバッグ表示が有効な場合は solidArea、移動先矩形、周辺タイルを描画し、衝突タイルは強調表示する。
- オーラはプレイヤーの HP が満タンのときにアクティブ化され、拡大・半透明で描画される。

- interactNPC: When the Enter key is pressed, start a conversation if an NPC is present; if no NPC is nearby, fire the sword when the aura is active and a sword is equipped, otherwise initiate a melee attack.
- contactMonster: On colliding with a monster, compute a knockback vector, apply invincibility and damage handling, show damage feedback, and perform a game‑over check if the player's life reaches zero.
- damageMonster: Apply damage to the specified monster; on death, handle drops, award experience, check for level‑up, play defeat effects, and schedule respawn. Chickens use a specialized damage handler.
- damageInteractiveTile: While attacking, damage destructible interactive tiles when the correct item is used; play sound and particle effects, decrement tile life, set temporary invincibility, and replace the tile with its destroyed form when its life reaches zero.
end note

@enduml